WEBVTT

00:07.520 --> 00:08.710
I'm late!

00:09.530 --> 00:12.100
Emi, are you listening? Emi!

00:13.480 --> 00:14.390
S-Sorry.

00:14.390 --> 00:18.160
I found a ramen place that 
looks good. Wanna do lunch?

00:18.160 --> 00:20.950
Yes, let's! It's been forever.

00:21.990 --> 00:23.160
Sorry.

00:23.470 --> 00:25.520
Hello?

00:25.520 --> 00:27.370
<i>Hello, Miss Yusa!</i>

00:28.170 --> 00:31.290
<i>I'm looking forward to dinner tomorrow!</i>

00:32.020 --> 00:33.670
I'm looking forward to it, too.

00:33.910 --> 00:37.430
By the way, Emilia, may I ask you 
to buy some groceries?

00:38.930 --> 00:42.030
What are you doing with that many eggs?

00:42.930 --> 00:47.780
I thought I'd try making the "quiche" 
Miss Sasaki told me about.

00:47.780 --> 00:50.440
Why make me come just 
because they're on sale?

00:50.440 --> 00:53.690
That sounds great! Alas Ramus likes eggs.

00:53.690 --> 00:54.450
Right?

00:54.750 --> 00:58.200
Mama, I wanna see Papa now.

01:01.070 --> 01:01.870
Huh?

01:02.250 --> 01:05.210
Satan, I know you're in there! Open up!

01:05.210 --> 01:07.690
Hello! Are you okay?

01:07.690 --> 01:09.210
Hey, guys—

01:21.770 --> 01:24.310
Oh, good. Here you are.

01:24.310 --> 01:26.920
Next time answer when I knock.

01:26.920 --> 01:28.730
Listen, everyone else disappeared.

01:29.180 --> 01:33.680
If you were gone, too, I really 
wouldn't know what to do.

01:34.740 --> 01:37.740
Hey, Satan, let's all eat together again...

01:49.410 --> 01:54.870
Why do I always want whatever I can't have?

01:59.010 --> 02:03.970
m 370 218 l 609 218 609 245 370 245

01:59.460 --> 02:01.020
Take care, everyone.

02:00.590 --> 02:03.970
<b>The Devil Vomits</b>

02:00.590 --> 02:03.970
<b>The Devil Vomits</b>

02:01.020 --> 02:02.990
What do we do now?

02:03.480 --> 02:06.520
All we need to do is wait.

02:06.520 --> 02:12.780
Mr. Maou and Miss Suzuno will save 
Miss Yusa, Alas Ramus, and Mr. Ashiya,

02:12.780 --> 02:14.340
and bring them back here.

02:17.880 --> 02:21.410
Man, didn't think we'd have to 
camp as soon as we got here.

02:21.410 --> 02:23.160
It is what it is.

02:24.470 --> 02:25.820
Hey, Suzuno.

02:25.820 --> 02:26.660
What?

02:27.420 --> 02:30.240
Isn't it a little soon to wear that?

02:30.240 --> 02:32.260
I can do what I want.

02:32.260 --> 02:35.810
And I need to get used to moving in this.

02:35.810 --> 02:38.420
Look, Maou! I match Suzuno!

02:38.920 --> 02:43.430
I know you guys just wanted to 
try your sleeping bags.

02:43.430 --> 02:44.290
Yeah!

02:44.290 --> 02:47.180
E-Excuse me? That is not true!

02:48.920 --> 02:50.480
Oops, it fell.

02:50.480 --> 02:53.190
Th-This is your fault, Satan!

02:53.190 --> 02:57.190
Whatever. I'll pitch the tent, 
so you go change somewhere.

02:59.200 --> 03:02.100
Oh, hey! Don't forget to use bug spray!

03:02.100 --> 03:03.700
I don't need your reminders!

03:04.220 --> 03:06.640
Hey, Acieth, lend a hand.

03:06.640 --> 03:07.950
Okay!

03:09.100 --> 03:13.460
So anyway, when did you 
and Nord get to Japan?

03:13.870 --> 03:18.460
Hmm... I'm only about a year old, so...

03:18.460 --> 03:20.660
One year? Seriously?

03:20.660 --> 03:21.590
Yep!

03:21.590 --> 03:27.380
I've lived with Dad since I was born. 
I dunno what happened before that!

03:27.380 --> 03:29.390
Since birth, eh?

03:30.050 --> 03:34.050
Actually, why are you the little sister
when you got a human form before Alas Ramus?

03:34.050 --> 03:34.610
Huh?

03:34.610 --> 03:38.110
And Nord seems to have gotten 
to Japan pretty early on...

03:38.110 --> 03:40.460
What a pain.

03:40.460 --> 03:41.680
What's a pain?

03:42.190 --> 03:46.610
Once this mess is over, we'll have 
to have a big family meeting.

03:46.610 --> 03:49.690
Whoa, Suzuno, you scared me!

03:49.690 --> 03:52.350
Your fault for not watching your back.

03:52.870 --> 03:56.640
What, do you have complaints 
about this outfit, too?

03:56.640 --> 04:01.880
Well, no, but I didn't know 
you ever dressed like that.

04:02.380 --> 04:04.510
These are Church vestments.

04:04.510 --> 04:07.580
They'll prevent suspicion 
when we pass through towns...

04:08.010 --> 04:10.070
Why are you looking at me like that?!

04:10.390 --> 04:13.930
It's just new, that's all. 
I only ever see you in a kimono.

04:15.970 --> 04:19.680
Kimono are nice, but you should try 
wearing Western clothes more, too.

04:21.320 --> 04:23.650
The vestments look pretty good on you.

04:24.060 --> 04:25.910
Wh-What?

04:26.990 --> 04:28.580
What's wrong, Suzuno?

04:28.580 --> 04:33.910
Well, I... I was used to wearing 
these long, heavy Church robes,

04:33.910 --> 04:38.770
so kimono were comfortable because 
they were a similar weight and length...

04:41.860 --> 04:43.920
You think these suit me?

04:43.920 --> 04:45.810
Yeah, I do.

04:46.200 --> 04:48.930
Plus, I may never have worn a kimono,

04:48.930 --> 04:51.680
but I know Western clothes 
are more cost-effective.

04:51.680 --> 04:53.830
I mean, consider the laundry.

04:55.180 --> 04:56.980
All done!

04:56.980 --> 05:01.190
Wh-What? I wasn't lying when 
I said they might look good!

05:01.190 --> 05:03.690
I-I won't be swayed again!

05:06.110 --> 05:08.440
I sense difficulties in my future...

05:23.840 --> 05:25.200
Stop your scooter.

05:26.740 --> 05:27.750
What is it?

05:31.600 --> 05:33.820
Guess we'll have to go around them.

05:33.820 --> 05:34.760
Yes.

05:38.060 --> 05:41.250
What's your reason 
for making me wear this armor?

05:41.250 --> 05:45.100
Can't you hear those voices full of hope?

05:46.860 --> 05:49.420
This nation seeks a hero

05:49.420 --> 05:55.620
to liberate Heavensky and 
the imprisoned Emperor-Unifier.

05:57.910 --> 05:59.550
Now, shall we go?

05:59.550 --> 06:04.630
This will be the Hero Emilia's 
second operation to retake Heavensky.

06:10.140 --> 06:11.420
So that's the hero!

06:11.420 --> 06:13.640
She really <i>is</i> alive!

06:13.640 --> 06:16.890
The hero has come to save Efzahan!

06:16.890 --> 06:19.990
Please help the Emperor-Unifier!

06:20.440 --> 06:24.920
Surely you hear their cheers, Emilia.

06:24.920 --> 06:28.310
All these useless Phaigan citizens 
can do is cling to that hope.

06:28.310 --> 06:32.530
They're just like the idiotic Malebranche

06:32.530 --> 06:36.140
who so firmly believed they 
could avenge King Satan.

06:36.140 --> 06:38.270
Olba, you—!

06:39.040 --> 06:45.370
You and I are about to go hunt down 
the fearsome demons eating away at Efzahan.

06:46.460 --> 06:48.670
What?! I don't wanna!

06:48.670 --> 06:49.980
There's no choice.

06:49.980 --> 06:54.180
The closer we get to the capital, 
the higher our chances of being discovered.

06:54.180 --> 06:57.190
We have to leave them somewhere.

06:57.190 --> 07:00.940
But I was just starting to master 
driving my Powered Dullahan III!

07:01.560 --> 07:03.870
I'm glad you're enjoying your scooter,

07:03.870 --> 07:06.940
but this may mean life or death 
for Emilia and the others.

07:09.210 --> 07:11.950
By the way, I've been wondering—

07:11.950 --> 07:15.340
Why do you always name 
your vehicles "Dullahan"?

07:16.450 --> 07:20.960
Aren't dullahans those demons 
from Earth mythology?

07:20.960 --> 07:23.010
Nice, you know your trivia!

07:23.010 --> 07:26.190
No dullahan types in 
the real demon realm, though.

07:26.710 --> 07:29.290
Then why use the name?

07:29.720 --> 07:32.840
Er, there's no deep reason...

07:33.720 --> 07:38.750
But before I made it to MgRonald's, 
Ashiya and I got axed from lots of jobs.

07:38.750 --> 07:39.480
Oh.

07:39.480 --> 07:43.040
Then I started working at MgRonald's 
and bought a bike to commute with.

07:43.040 --> 07:45.210
It was a huge purchase.

07:45.210 --> 07:47.930
It'd suck to get axed again 
with no savings, right?

07:48.580 --> 07:49.830
True.

07:50.840 --> 07:52.110
Wait, don't tell me—

07:52.590 --> 07:55.720
Yep. It was a good luck thing.

07:55.720 --> 07:58.370
Dullahans are headless demons, right?

07:58.830 --> 08:02.580
There's no head to chop off, 
therefore they can't get the axe.

08:02.580 --> 08:03.870
That's awful.

08:03.870 --> 08:06.700
Hey, you're the one who asked!

08:07.630 --> 08:10.350
I'd almost rather hear 
that you name them that

08:10.350 --> 08:13.380
because you're addicted to 
the Demon King lifestyle.

08:13.380 --> 08:15.820
That would just be sad!

08:16.690 --> 08:19.410
It's just, your reason is so human!

08:19.410 --> 08:22.390
Oh, shut up! Now you're just mocking me.

08:24.590 --> 08:29.290
Tell me something. Why did 
your kind come to Ente Isla?

08:29.290 --> 08:30.400
What?

08:30.910 --> 08:34.910
I mean when you tried to 
rule the five continents.

08:34.910 --> 08:37.870
Ruling a place is completely 
different from destroying it.

08:38.280 --> 08:42.160
And Alciel brilliantly ruled Efzahan.

08:44.320 --> 08:47.470
The good Chiho is scarily 
perceptive sometimes.

08:47.470 --> 08:51.670
Or perhaps she was able to figure you 
out <i>because</i> she didn't know anything.

08:52.160 --> 08:56.300
She realized that you were a king 
who led the citizens of the demon realm.

08:56.300 --> 09:01.310
Yeah, I'm the demon king. So what?

09:02.610 --> 09:03.810
Oof.

09:03.810 --> 09:05.740
What are you doing?

09:06.210 --> 09:10.690
A member of the clergy never discloses 
secrets learned during a confession.

09:10.690 --> 09:13.940
Sitting like this, you 
don't have to see my face.

09:14.970 --> 09:17.950
Tell me, king of demons:

09:18.430 --> 09:22.440
Why did you invade Ente Isla?

09:24.940 --> 09:28.580
Back when I was born, 
the demon realm was a shitty world.

09:28.580 --> 09:31.340
Violence was everything.

09:31.820 --> 09:34.970
I raised an army because 
I wanted to change that world.

09:35.920 --> 09:39.820
My conquest went smoothly thanks to 
demons like Camio and Alciel,

09:39.820 --> 09:42.430
and we made a new nation 
more advanced than any before it.

09:42.840 --> 09:45.940
It almost completely eliminated 
the deaths of weaker demons.

09:46.480 --> 09:49.350
But I made one big miscalculation.

09:49.350 --> 09:50.500
Miscalculation?

09:51.000 --> 09:54.390
Demons draw magic, 
the energy they need to survive,

09:54.390 --> 09:57.390
from emotions like fear and despair.

09:57.860 --> 10:01.010
My unification of the demon realm 
brought about order and peace,

10:01.010 --> 10:04.370
and fear and despair gradually disappeared.

10:04.370 --> 10:09.270
As a result, our magical reserves 
began to rapidly decline.

10:09.600 --> 10:13.630
Which was inevitable in hindsight, 
because we'd gotten rid of its source.

10:14.630 --> 10:18.890
It was my fault, and the realm would 
have starved if I didn't do something.

10:18.890 --> 10:21.390
Is that why you attacked Ente Isla?

10:22.060 --> 10:25.640
I invaded other countries to 
restore our depleted resources

10:25.640 --> 10:27.240
through plunder and colonization.

10:27.960 --> 10:30.380
The stereotypical motivation 
for a war, right?

10:30.960 --> 10:32.110
Yes.

10:32.110 --> 10:35.640
If we destroyed humanity, the same 
problem would happen again.

10:35.640 --> 10:40.240
So I figured we could just rule the humans
through an appropriate amount of fear.

10:40.240 --> 10:43.620
I gave my troops strict orders: 
show no mercy to those who oppose us,

10:43.620 --> 10:45.930
but always accept a surrender.

10:46.450 --> 10:48.500
You know the rest.

10:48.980 --> 10:51.830
Emi freed one continent after another.

10:51.830 --> 10:54.260
I fled, and I ended up in Japan.

10:55.130 --> 10:59.470
Once we invaded Ente Isla, 
I researched constantly.

10:59.470 --> 11:03.640
How come humans could create 
civilizations without killing each other?

11:04.380 --> 11:07.640
Here, I never understood the difference 
between us and the humans—

11:08.240 --> 11:11.840
but I figured it out after 
just three days in Japan.

11:11.840 --> 11:13.150
And?

11:14.060 --> 11:16.900
You eat food, and we don't. That's all.

11:17.470 --> 11:20.240
Demons can survive on magic alone.

11:20.240 --> 11:24.510
But humans can't. 
They can't survive without food.

11:24.510 --> 11:26.660
Food is why they earn money.

11:27.700 --> 11:31.330
Which makes them different, starting with 
the very structure of their societies.

11:32.490 --> 11:35.790
I didn't even know that simple fact.

11:35.790 --> 11:41.050
And many followers who believed in me 
died because of my ignorance.

11:41.460 --> 11:48.060
But you were forced to weigh the human world
against the lives of your subjects, correct?

11:48.400 --> 11:50.820
Because you were a king.

11:52.590 --> 11:56.060
What sin torments you?

11:57.000 --> 12:02.190
My sin is that I betrayed the trust of my 
subjects and drove them to their deaths.

12:02.820 --> 12:05.510
That I took the wrong path as a king.

12:06.150 --> 12:10.080
And what must your penance be?

12:11.030 --> 12:15.830
Continue to live as a king anyway, 
until the moment my kingship ends.

12:16.470 --> 12:21.840
Exactly. You'll become a king who 
rules demons and humans, won't you?

12:22.920 --> 12:25.690
Right, this is a confession, huh?

12:26.580 --> 12:30.850
Does your God forgive demons' sins, too?

12:31.180 --> 12:36.100
Conventional wisdom holds that 
a demon king's sins are unforgivable.

12:36.100 --> 12:39.480
Hey, it's not cool to say 
that after making me confess!

12:40.150 --> 12:42.700
<i>I</i> forgive you, though.

12:43.550 --> 12:44.860
Suzuno?

12:44.860 --> 12:49.240
Satan, king of demons, 
I have heard your confession.

12:49.700 --> 12:52.480
I have judged all your words true,

12:52.480 --> 12:57.140
and I absolve you in my name, 
the name of Crestia Bel...

12:57.140 --> 13:01.350
regardless of whether God 
or anyone else in this world refuses to.

13:02.860 --> 13:05.680
Did you eat something weird at dinner?

13:08.390 --> 13:10.260
Maybe so.

13:21.260 --> 13:22.690
Report!

13:23.130 --> 13:26.410
The Inlaid Crimson Scarves on the front 
lines have encountered an enemy leader!

13:26.410 --> 13:28.200
Battle in progress!

13:28.610 --> 13:30.600
Understood. I'll join them.

13:30.600 --> 13:32.480
No need!

13:34.250 --> 13:36.350
If I go, this'll be over in an instant!

13:36.350 --> 13:39.460
You're the commander in chief 
of this volunteer army.

13:39.460 --> 13:42.970
Refrain from acting rashly.

13:44.920 --> 13:47.470
Then I declare this as commander in chief:

13:47.860 --> 13:50.070
Let's invite the Malebranche to surrender

13:50.070 --> 13:52.720
before there's any more 
unnecessary loss of life!

13:52.720 --> 13:57.490
Our objective is to free cities, 
not to commit massacres!

13:57.490 --> 14:01.530
Are you suggesting 
that we allow demons to live?

14:02.220 --> 14:03.430
I—

14:03.430 --> 14:05.360
Idea link from the front lines!

14:06.240 --> 14:08.860
After a fierce battle, 
the enemy leader has been routed!

14:08.860 --> 14:11.850
Gwenvan City is liberated!

14:12.370 --> 14:13.580
Wonderful!

14:15.830 --> 14:20.380
Well, Ashiya—excuse me, 
Demon General Alciel?

14:20.840 --> 14:22.880
What's it like to be back in Heavensky?

14:22.880 --> 14:24.460
Sickening.

14:25.090 --> 14:29.270
What job are you trying 
to foist on me, exactly?

14:30.620 --> 14:32.890
Your role is super simple.

14:33.660 --> 14:37.010
Just lean back and relax on that throne.

14:37.010 --> 14:39.160
The rest will take care of itself.

14:39.160 --> 14:43.320
I see. You want to be able 
to say, "Alciel has returned."

14:43.320 --> 14:44.080
Hmm?

14:44.540 --> 14:49.530
After all, of the four great generals,
 I'm the only one undefeated.

14:49.530 --> 14:51.890
The demon army and the Hero are back.

14:51.890 --> 14:56.070
The angels intend to have 
Emilia defeat us, am I right?

14:56.070 --> 14:57.380
You got me!

14:57.380 --> 15:01.710
I guess you're not just some guy freaking 
out about egg sizes at the grocery store.

15:02.160 --> 15:05.950
Where have you been spying 
on me from, you vermin?!

15:05.950 --> 15:07.920
You're so mean.

15:07.920 --> 15:12.810
I assume Heaven cajoled Olba 
and the demons into this.

15:13.260 --> 15:14.800
What are you after?

15:18.310 --> 15:21.080
Since you asked, I want to save Heaven.

15:21.080 --> 15:22.410
Excuse me?

15:22.410 --> 15:25.070
I only want one thing from you.

15:25.070 --> 15:29.520
When Emilia gets here, 
keep fighting as long as you can.

15:30.410 --> 15:34.820
It's just one less demon in the world—
one less enemy of mankind, right?

15:35.640 --> 15:38.030
He was the enemy.

15:38.030 --> 15:40.550
Demons are humanity's enemies...

15:40.990 --> 15:44.080
So... why am I so upset?

15:44.480 --> 15:45.720
Mama?

15:54.260 --> 15:55.300
You—

15:56.710 --> 15:57.950
Stay quiet.

16:01.380 --> 16:03.190
Someone's coming.

16:06.220 --> 16:07.270
An enemy?

16:07.270 --> 16:10.630
I'd sure welcome an ally right now, but...

16:11.780 --> 16:14.950
What's this called again? A scooter?

16:16.450 --> 16:18.450
Who's there?

16:18.450 --> 16:22.710
The Devil? Alciel? Lucifer? The Sasaki girl?

16:22.710 --> 16:25.280
Or is it "Crestia Bel"?

16:26.070 --> 16:28.960
Shockingly, it's not an enemy.

16:30.120 --> 16:33.920
I assume this isn't a coincidental meeting,

16:33.920 --> 16:35.380
Albert Ende.

16:35.700 --> 16:36.730
Nope.

16:36.730 --> 16:37.970
What's that?

16:37.970 --> 16:39.610
A new kind of demon?

16:39.610 --> 16:41.730
Who are you calling a demon?!

16:43.230 --> 16:46.980
Why did this happen?! Where did Olba go?!

16:46.980 --> 16:50.730
I think we ought to have 
followed His Majesty's orders.

16:50.730 --> 16:52.510
How dare you, Farfa?!

16:53.710 --> 16:55.240
General Alciel!

16:55.240 --> 16:57.810
Give me the short explanation for this.

16:58.530 --> 17:04.750
I'm here because of a rumor about people 
in Church robes driving weird wagons.

17:04.750 --> 17:06.500
Looks like I hit the jackpot.

17:06.500 --> 17:09.580
Enough people saw us to start a big rumor?

17:09.580 --> 17:13.510
No, about a million rumors are 
going around Efzahan right now.

17:13.510 --> 17:16.010
I just had a hunch about this one.

17:16.010 --> 17:18.890
Did you come to rescue Emilia?

17:18.890 --> 17:23.510
Yes, but what happened to the good Emerada?

17:23.510 --> 17:27.520
I tried sending her an idea link,
 but there was no answer.

17:29.650 --> 17:32.370
The day Eme was supposed to 
meet up with Emilia,

17:32.370 --> 17:36.020
she got a summons from Saint 
Aire's imperial capital.

17:36.020 --> 17:36.650
What?

17:37.490 --> 17:40.120
Must've been a move by the Church.

17:40.120 --> 17:44.030
They branded Eme an apostate 
who defied the Church's will.

17:44.030 --> 17:47.060
It was to cover up Olba's wrongdoing.

17:47.670 --> 17:50.590
I hear she has to appear 
before the Inquisition.

17:50.590 --> 17:52.950
Without my permission?

17:52.950 --> 17:57.930
Eme's current position is the only 
thing securing my safety and Emilia's.

17:57.930 --> 18:01.680
I went to Emilia's village, 
but no one was there.

18:02.140 --> 18:05.180
When I returned to the capital, 
they wouldn't let me see Eme.

18:05.180 --> 18:09.090
They said it's a measure to prevent her 
from any wrongdoing during the trial.

18:09.090 --> 18:11.940
So that's why she couldn't contact me.

18:11.940 --> 18:16.950
If she got caught trying to contact you, 
it'd cause you trouble, too.

18:18.030 --> 18:20.520
Albert, join forces with us.

18:20.900 --> 18:23.950
Rescuing Emi won't be enough to settle this.

18:24.950 --> 18:31.710
I see. In other words, you let Olba 
and some Heavenly vermin dupe you,

18:31.710 --> 18:34.040
you failed to retake the Devil's Castle,

18:34.040 --> 18:37.570
and all you've managed to do is 
sacrifice demon lives in vain.

18:37.570 --> 18:39.220
Correct?

18:39.850 --> 18:42.140
I can make no excuses, sir.

18:42.140 --> 18:43.470
But General Alciel—

18:43.470 --> 18:46.220
Silence, Barbariccia! You imbecile!

18:46.600 --> 18:49.100
I won't fault you for raising an army.

18:49.100 --> 18:55.110
But why didn't you follow the orders that 
His Majesty gave you through Farfarello?!

18:55.990 --> 19:00.450
King Satan told you all to 
return to the demon realm.

19:00.450 --> 19:03.120
I am ashamed of myself, sir.

19:03.490 --> 19:07.550
But if we'd gotten the sacred sword, 
this wouldn't have happened!

19:07.550 --> 19:09.120
Sacred sword?

19:09.120 --> 19:14.630
Emilia's sword, Better Half, is a holy 
being born of Yesod, a sephirah.

19:15.000 --> 19:19.730
We have no celestial force. 
In our hands it would have no power—

19:19.730 --> 19:23.620
E-E-Excuse me, General Alciel, but you're wrong.

19:23.620 --> 19:24.640
What?

19:24.640 --> 19:29.180
I believe you know that Farfa 
put that "Erone" to work.

19:29.180 --> 19:34.150
A sephirah's power is not something 
only bestowed on angels and humans.

19:35.650 --> 19:36.940
That's...

19:38.150 --> 19:42.410
As you see, it responds 
strongly to our magic as well.

19:42.830 --> 19:47.990
I-It can't be! The sephiroth 
and the sacred sword aren't holy?

19:48.910 --> 19:53.280
Where is Nord Justina, 
the man brought here with me?

19:53.280 --> 19:56.920
We've locked him in a room in Heavensky.

19:57.350 --> 20:00.180
And Nord didn't have a sacred sword?

20:00.180 --> 20:02.180
N-No, sir.

20:03.620 --> 20:05.670
I still don't understand the objective,

20:05.670 --> 20:08.570
but I'm starting to see 
what Gabriel has engineered.

20:08.570 --> 20:09.430
Sir?

20:09.430 --> 20:15.310
How pathetic that I, Alciel, 
should have to dance to his tune...

20:19.550 --> 20:21.580
Dance well, okay?

20:21.580 --> 20:25.200
I've waited 2,000 years 
for a new Great Devil to be born.

20:25.920 --> 20:28.600
I consider this the last chance.

20:29.200 --> 20:35.330
Albert, let's mess up their farce 
like they've messed with our comrades!

20:35.330 --> 20:37.480
Fine with me, but first,

20:37.480 --> 20:41.890
is that girl the one 
who fused with Emilia's sword?

20:41.890 --> 20:45.430
Nope, she's not Alas Ramus.

20:45.840 --> 20:50.210
It's fair to say that she's 
the nucleus of another sacred sword.

20:50.580 --> 20:52.370
Check this out!

20:52.370 --> 20:54.820
Acieth, go back to sword form.

20:55.640 --> 21:00.610
Okay... but it might not go well, 
'cause I don't feel good.

21:00.610 --> 21:01.700
Huh?

21:01.700 --> 21:04.340
I'll try it anyway.

21:10.680 --> 21:11.510
Huh?

21:14.130 --> 21:17.000
For a sacred sword, it's really... uh...

21:17.000 --> 21:19.610
Acieth, what's the matter?

21:19.610 --> 21:24.260
Mmm... It's kinda like he's 
refusing to let me use my power?

21:24.260 --> 21:26.130
Who's refusing?

21:26.130 --> 21:28.210
You, of course.

21:28.210 --> 21:29.790
Huh? Me?

21:30.260 --> 21:33.140
I'm the one who told you to do it, so why—

21:34.270 --> 21:35.520
Oh, crap.

21:40.490 --> 21:44.380
I'm confused, but I think this means 
we can't use the sacred sword?

21:44.380 --> 21:46.280
I think I agree?

21:46.280 --> 21:48.780
Something feels off, though.

21:51.420 --> 21:57.290
Damn it, why did that happen? 
Everything's been normal until today!

21:58.160 --> 22:00.790
Satan, don't you find this odd?

22:00.790 --> 22:01.980
Find what odd?

22:03.630 --> 22:05.580
We're back in Ente Isla...

22:06.940 --> 22:10.050
so why aren't you in your demon form?

22:11.160 --> 22:13.370

